            "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ucupumar/ucupaint/tarball/2.4.9",
            "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ucupumar/ucupaint/zipball/2.4.9",
            "body": "## \u2b50 What\u2019s New\r\nNew bake types contributed by @jakeblakeley \r\n- Curvature bake type (#411)\r\n- Thickness bake type(#408)\r\n-  Wireframe bake type (#410)\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"new_bake_types\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b91327e2-ff32-4ab6-9ff2-a8a788ce5610\" />\r\n\r\n## \ud83d\udc1e Bugfixes\r\n\r\n- Fix: Error when deleting a layer with no source\r\n- Fix: Bake target subchannels UI doesn't get saved\r\n- Fix: Non-UV image layers/masks can be mistakenly converted to use image atlas\r\n- Fix: Duplicating a blank image using UDIM atlas won't copy the correct tile size\r\n- Fix: Sponsors panel can cause a crash since it loads thumbnail data in a non-main thread\r\n- Fix: Cannot set the correct channel index when creating a new layer if Blender is a debug build\r\n- Fix: Errors when updating version 1.x nodes with displacement setup in Blender 5.0+\r\n- Fix: Sculpting VDM image in Blender 5.2 will produce a wrong mesh\r\n- Fix: Sculpting VDM Layer when the object has multires modifier will crash Blender\r\n- Fix: Can't add new layers when there is a Geometry Nodes modifier with color output on the stack (Blender 5.2)\r\n- Fix: Can't bake all channels when there are multiple objects and a Geometry Nodes modifier with vector output on the stack (Blender 5.2)\r\n- Fix: Cannot open attributes outputted from geometry nodes (Blender 5.2)\r\n\r\n## \ud83d\udc1e Bugfixes for Ucupaint Plus\r\n\r\n- Fix: Ucupaint can mistakenly download unnecessary modules when installing PSD-Tools\r\n\r\n## \ud83d\udcbb Compatibilty\r\nTested and compatible with all Blender versions starting from Blender 2.76 to Blender 5.2. \r\n- For Blender 2.80 to 5.2+, you can download the main zip file (_ucupaint-2.4.9.zip_). \r\n- For Blender 2.76 to 2.79, you need to download the legacy zip (_ucupaint-blender_27x-legacy-2.4.9.zip_). \r\n\r\n## \ud83d\ude4bSupport Ucupaint!\r\nSupport Ucupaint development by becoming [a Github sponsor](https://github.com/sponsors/ucupumar) and get the **PSD layers import-export**! ",
